		{"id":"2cb025e9cb4f3f6a","x":-540,"y":-350,"width":250,"height":340,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"**What is the problem?**\n\nWhy dynamic obstacle perception is difficult in robotics?\n\nWhat are the limitations of existing reactive systems?\n\nDefine what is detection, tracking, prediction."},
